1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,799
Learning is fundamental.
But how do we prove what we can actually build and do?

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:11,199
Welcome to SEVA Skill Passport.
Proof of Course → Proof of Ability.

3
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Powered by Team OG — Opportunity & Growth

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Every year, millions of students complete online courses
and receive completion certificates.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,800
But a certificate only confirms attendance.
It cannot show architectural decisions made in code,

6
00:00:30,199 --> 00:00:35,000
the edge cases tested, or practical problem-solving
demonstrated during real development.

7
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:39,200
There is a missing link between passive study
and verified competency.

8
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:47,000
Our team explored the challenges of demonstrating practical skills
beyond course-completion certificates.

9
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:55,000
Through our case-study investigation and consultation,
we sought perspectives and suggestions to better understand the problem.

10
00:00:55,500 --> 00:01:01,500
This informed our goal: to connect learning
with clearer evidence of practical ability.

11
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:10,000
Introducing SEVA Skill Passport:
a unified digital learning and capability verification framework.

12
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:15,799
Moving learners from basic course completion
to tangible, cryptographic skill evidence

13
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:19,500
that can be independently inspected by educators and hiring teams.

14
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:25,000
Here is our live working prototype, running locally.
Beginning with our full-screen branded welcome intro,

15
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:30,000
learners explore structured tracks like Full Stack Development.
Our zero-friction onboarding includes one-click demo access.

16
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:35,500
Inside the dashboard, student progress is tracked
with active lesson milestones.

17
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,500
Every challenge and code submission is linked to verifiable cryptographic proof,

18
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,500
providing an authentic evidence portfolio.

19
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:53,000
Existing platforms—from traditional learning management systems
to portfolio websites—solve individual pieces of the puzzle.

20
00:01:53,500 --> 00:02:01,000
SEVA Skill Passport connects them into a continuous journey:
Course Learning → Practical Sandboxes → Project Assessments → Skill Passport.

21
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:09,500
A unified continuum from curriculum to cryptographic proof.

22
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:16,500
Built on modern production technologies: Next.js App Router,
React, and TypeScript for responsive interfaces,

23
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:22,000
styled with Tailwind CSS, backed by Supabase and PostgreSQL,

24
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:27,000
and secured with SHA-256 cryptographic evidence hashing.

25
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:31,000
Developed iteratively as a working prototype with modular services.

26
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Our intended benefits focus on transparent skill representation,
empowering learners and simplifying evaluation.

27
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:44,000
Our roadmap advances from prototype validation to student testing,
richer assessment rubrics, and institutional integration.

28
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:50,000
Driven by Team OG — Opportunity & Growth.

29
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:55,500
SEVA Skill Passport.
Proof of Course → Proof of Ability.

30
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,800
Building a clearer bridge between learning and demonstrated ability.
